{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"9bcc884b0e342bd59c26ecf953bcd0a7ce0be56a44a95eee01272b5e756d0dd5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄们，我心里所愿的，向 神所求的，是要以色列人得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我可以证明，他们向 神有热心，但不是按着真知识；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["因为不知道 神的义，想要立自己的义，就不服 神的义了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["律法的总结就是基督，使凡信他的都得着义。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["求告主名的必要得救"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西写着说：「人若行那出于律法的义，就必因此活着。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["惟有出于信心的义如此说：「你不要心里说：谁要升到天上去呢？（就是要领下基督来；）"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["谁要下到阴间去呢？（就是要领基督从死里上来。）」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他到底怎么说呢？他说：",{"text":"这道离你不远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正在你口里，在你心里—","poem":1},"（就是我们所传信主的道。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你若口里认耶稣为主，心里信 神叫他从死里复活，就必得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因为，人心里相信就可以称义，口里承认就可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["经上说：「凡信他的人必不至于羞愧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["犹太人和希腊人并没有分别，因为众人同有一位主；他也厚待一切求告他的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为「凡求告主名的就必得救」。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，人未曾信他，怎能求他呢？未曾听见他，怎能信他呢？没有传道的，怎能听见呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["若没有奉差遣，怎能传道呢？如经上所记：「报福音、传喜信的人，他们的脚踪何等佳美！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["只是人没有都听从福音，因为以赛亚说：「主啊，我们所传的有谁信呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["可见，信道是从听道来的，听道是从基督的话来的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但我说，人没有听见吗？诚然听见了。",{"text":"他们的声音传遍天下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的言语传到地极。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我再说，以色列人不知道吗？先有摩西说：",{"text":"我要用那不成子民的惹动你们的愤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用那无知的民触动你们的怒气。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["又有以赛亚放胆说：",{"text":"没有寻找我的，我叫他们遇见；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有访问我的，我向他们显现。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["至于以色列人，他说：「我整天伸手招呼那悖逆顶嘴的百姓。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}